# Auto-applied by MSBuild/`dotnet` when run from this directory.
# Forces the WASM flavor so a bare `dotnet build` / `dotnet run` / `dotnet publish`
# here works without typing -p:KmilaWasm=true. This must be a GLOBAL property
# (it affects restore, where Kmila.Shared's transitive Microsoft.AspNetCore.App
# FrameworkReference is resolved — no browser-wasm pack → NETSDK1082 without it).
-p:KmilaWasm=true
